{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018NBK7Ps49DQh7QTB5eaKAr","type":"tool_result","content":"# Total Farmers Markets (US States Only)\n\nBased on the data provided, I summed the `farmers_markets` column for all 50 US states, excluding the District of Columbia and territories (Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands).\n\n**Total: 10,048 farmers markets**\n\nThis figure represents the combined count across all states from California (647) through South Dakota (17), reflecting the agricultural infrastructure dedicated to direct-to-consumer food sales across the nation."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0e7558a8-31f3-4c78-94f2-83a88c4720e4","uuid":"688106b4-18b9-454b-aac1-9fc47e91d831","timestamp":"2026-08-16T20:10:07.522Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":2651,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Total Farmers Markets (US States Only)\n\nBased on the data provided, I summed the `farmers_markets` column for all 50 US states, excluding the District of Columbia and territories (Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands).\n\n**Total: 10,048 farmers markets**\n\nThis figure represents the combined count across all states from California (647) through South Dakota (17), reflecting the agricultural infrastructure dedicated to direct-to-consumer food sales across the nation.","durationMs":3432,"url":"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv"}}
